      why_neyo:
        'Ne-Yo has been part of my life since 2006. His music has been with me through different stages of my life, bringing comfort and making many moments feel lighter.\n\nMy admiration goes beyond the music. I admire his songwriting, creativity and performances, but also the person he shows himself to be.\n\nOver the years, I have also seen how music can connect people who might otherwise never have crossed paths. Ne-Yo has brought me friendships and memories that I might never have experienced otherwise.',
